# Monkshu environment variables — copy to .env and fill in real values.
# Any conf value in the format "env:VARIABLE_NAME" is resolved from these
# at module load via Monkshu's utility function. Unset variables fail startup.
# Servers auto read these files on startup. Alternatively the keys in the file
# can be empty (files themselves have to be present) and environment can be
# setup using any of the launch scripts themselves also. 
#
# The frontend environment file is at -> frontend/server/conf/.env
# The backend environment file is at -> backend/server/conf/.env
#
# backend/server/conf/crypt.json -> "key": "env:MONKSHU_CRYPT_KEY"
# MONKSHU_CRYPT_KEY=your-crypt-key-here
# INSECURE_JWT=true
#
# frontend/server/conf/crypt.json -> "key": "env:MONKSHU_CRYPT_KEY"
# MONKSHU_CRYPT_KEY=your-crypt-key-here
